@ScoreApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5239

### Display: all judges
GET {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Judges
Accept: application/json

###

### Display: single judge
GET {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Judges/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Add judge (judge number + PIN are generated server-side)
POST {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Judges
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Judge 1 (John)",
  "assignedRound": "Evening Gown"
}

###

### Edit judge (name + round assignment only)
PUT {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Judges/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Judge 1 (John D.)",
  "assignedRound": "Evening Gown"
}

###

### Delete judge (409 if the judge has recorded submissions)
DELETE {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Judges/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Judge login (401 if judge number + PIN don't match)
POST {{ScoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/judge-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judgeNumber": 1,
  "pinCode": "1234"
}

###
